 🚫 Kalshi said it would impose a lifetime ban (the prediction market's first) and a $71,356 penalty on former Republican Rep. George Santos for allegations he profited from bets on his own attendance at President Trump's State of the Union address. ( CNBC )

 ⛳️ LIV Golf has reportedly offered a settlement to players worth pennies on the dollar for their contracts ahead of a potential bankruptcy filing. ( FT )

 ⚖️ The FTC is poised to sue Amazon, alleging the company manipulated prices that merchants pay for ads on the e-commerce platform. ( Axios )

 
 
